I come home.
I go to the kitchen.
In that video, the chef says.
"First, wash the poha with water."
I take half a kilo of poha.
I wash the poha well in a colander.
Then the chef says, "After that, keep it aside."
So, I keep the washed poha on the counter.
It slowly becomes soft.
Now I prepare the vegetables.
The next instruction in the video is.
"Then chop the onion and green chili."
I take a quarter kilo of onions.
I carefully chop them into small pieces.
After that, I also carefully chop two green chilies.
Now my prep work is complete.
Everything is on the counter.
I am ready to cook.
